			<item><link target="src-packages-app-src-solid-appanatomyfloors-ts" link="/src/app/solid/AppAnatomyFloors.ts"><text title="src/app/solid/AppAnatomyFloors.ts" code>AppAnatomyFloors.ts</></>: which elements are layers, and which can't come apart</>
		</>
	</>
